  "question": {
    "text": "When a battery of emf <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> with internal resistance <math><mn>0.5</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math> is charged by a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>120</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>DC</mi></math> supply using a series resistance of <math><mn>15.5</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>, then what is the terminal voltage (in volt) of the battery?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "11.5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, emf of the battery <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><br />The internal resistance of the battery, <math><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math><br /><br />The voltage of D. C supply = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>120</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><br />External resistance, <math><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15.5</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math><br /><br />When the battery of emf <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> is charged from a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>DC</mi></math> supply of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>120</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>, the effective emf in the circular is<br /><br /><math><mi>ε</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>112</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>V</mi></math><br /><br />The total resistance of the circuit <math><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>15.5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math> Current in the circuit during charging<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>112</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math>&nbsp;The terminal voltage of the battery,<br /><br /><math><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0.5</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>11.</mn><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>",
